  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C057.signal_basis",
    "value": "A stage recurs as the greatest documented delay burden across both investigation weeks, while ambiguous cases remain unresolved. Missing records could reverse the ranking, in which case the mapping directs a recording and handoff trial first.",
    "scope": "The two-week investigation and its provisional stage-selection decision; the persistence rule supplies practical selection guidance, not statistical proof or causal identification.",
